; font-size: 16px;"&gt;毛里求斯表示，如果查戈斯群岛主权僵局&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/pGF1hDHOph7_eBvy2lvN0RJSuboQDvefqIorCz4jMIyGke-r6rI9VWtjRRbDK2G1HNfF66zNHePYO8Vd2xL7usFwq7DlFboeQGtnUg1GSAPsNUxPiTJh7mdO0k5IeIwt8GN8UFbTfco6Va-9Nj6IWoPyCqh5VaTzozzzueaqhLtP--_AOrBlSQwkE7m9nvUCs12oIZfun_0mhrC6zdOXbBX2VqxpikH3yO_-7d5aDqH-wT5DP642CMUTllmhaiGlelpIb_X2TZ3VhIPFZH65LRihnW0_BYzh6IXTMUOJuMl-wx-czYvTb7iVsfy1nE7N2duoEjq-xfnb05S8wlJqK57n5IZ7ZsZcBfzqkvxz8ew_3XABU5co5s2xQhl-k6CSI2BgCcgc8cycuCDyBsQePjuWpe6PEiafL_NFHOZj6T79pvrwEmHBxcf0t2FwS7AXBx6CFJasF4yBK1MDYws8wXWF4NahtzDHyTK_TBDPF9QHIKMFf411tuVr__z7a-Nkhl9fxFturdSTYhSnfwF3Tdb96T6LKH7j0Y5Gw9uUXw/RnlAwajD4AUAB7QtO0j4OpeKsL48Bi26/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="毛里求斯警告英国因查戈斯移交陷入停滞而采取法律行动"&gt;得不到解决&lt;/a&gt;，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;它将对英国采取法律行动。&lt;/strong&gt;查戈斯群岛也是美国使用的战略军事基地的所在地。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;随着联合国维和人员开始&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/qm4rCFmztBptMuP4-pjsx0xkyY3L7h6WZnSL_Ndir93HtqbrkBn7y5EA8AvBFy2A3nkgeaFZ86gc6hAg2ZqFPwQwY01XYs9D1U4IexFbcDC6kDQPNCrJwO98RpAGy0pUCmhVgf-ihbB3Ps4LvC-wh7CWsvqFAL_TkF9c_eSPTmRYHSog7Tl-HgbSeeLiLloM5yIgaiDmx0TkpC-PFoxCzepjTU1-tCkouXsm5nTNb7v2LD_5h6WgK1d9TJqX3oj5mGPw2oocs8kYfLFMUcevSt2k-1_yG-8UPAEgjSjjzKdYGH3BMc1KFkAWTUB9vPFp-xnsu31TWMp2OTbJbkIn-IelqxWT3mDwZImtx8XzpeRMmQfOCskirwUM4S1jbIxxsV_AElwZn_n-OVty7T81Y2CCANi7Wk9wigEAVJ5PzB2yoj3ObnDjUiaOlaWx0hhvnuDoq1Bkk_diX9CyHCaoBJpaYVuxyBF8rIJyQkbN0qMkdfgyO_iU1i6JtKzwcV5_uXcLOIXQooOLasgXAkFZZPb4l8hprwl8rmk67EKk6sE/ytGFdhOJl832MLzocGgHZgnvn3v6k5yi/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="联合国维和部队开始撤离时，美国敦促西撒哈拉保持平静"&gt;离开摩洛哥和寻求独立的叛乱分子争夺的领土&lt;/a&gt;，&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;美国敦促各方保持冷静并充分尊重&lt;/strong&gt;西撒哈拉停火协议。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;美国国会民主党人&lt;/strong&gt;正在准备&lt;a href="h