e: 16px;"&gt;—&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/7G8UdqmHZmWRwTzUKDXQdtZOpxUc8BeFaMCeGGNmxnTHaj45iSmVJo_EFUDkImG5HqjX8onLAKDGaXOy9u4k0YsHX3Vf_K7g79dWkw29k-7wBRJ4Ujn5r7uXRIQaQ_snmxH3OCg9ia2nxgNc-U4S2usxTTwi5tFZJx6i5SluRLmNED5Kbsvze_hGLxzaOPwI5zBSmAAucEbuLMbtfj5GYcVjXgXLsEN4iydEfDNszUiy6H2Qe_UyALi7JiD-PuTzKW4jwp4iF8ZjjTQdAQbjpoPuAO6aaXgScJpQRJ9x8m68tnzk5bVkt8XTghtJ7Qn_Q7TJkcKb0n0cFZ3h9dTKpy2zhDdq1bZsQR6dvprut48dkBhlx-MV-PYQAIhxxPpqhb9LotE3629RRddeWRzr_7VrsLrRdBQSVIrUxCOsMdaXNdIPuYeGtSqtBpJg3EkWoGsryWLQf0EyizQk0C4Zdw/ngXGPZw5NB2MPiZ26JJoizw7k06_jJL3/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="David Rovella - 总编辑：Bloomberg Digital |彭博社"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;大卫·E·罗维拉&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;今天您需要了解什么&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;英伟达董事会不打算&lt;/strong&gt;让黄仁勋重新担任该芯片制造商的首席执行官。但这并没有阻止这位倒下首席执行官的朋友——包括白宫的一位——提出他回归的可能性，尽管黄仁勋参与引发了美国国家安全丑闻。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;现在， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/gdcLG8VLLqIBe5sDNAVDHIvF7AgXoc2PC1o57IvZctMawigLCGITNXrkBpV19XQt0ScudIi6H2CW4aS6Sa2wIEMjMMZ6fFGvXrA2bpjuv3mgraHxAC9RcYa-7LjGcId1pntH0UYHyhUih8jLmEnC3atP7AvhA7ZAjHIqzPvQGgYKfbvwtkljSJBmreE11e12gQJxITQ2Ej2iUlUWd87xB4FMk4Ccvwcs8WRRlxGbykpreQitXJHlPRWx4S1xvuI8FzHDU6g72l94wO6tOtWA5x3kNcMv8rkebfs1xq-rDc0QcpHPwsJ20zB5xeSABxRKnPAesQrm2gNTh1urrl2p3Ya7l4pHFWKIzPnjlwQyeRrHn0FA2qM5t5SVRHx4XnXHbRVouHWLZ3UreqXD_BrILFAUxztWKQGQW5IZKR8i5Jtf70IdPlGPvxTP89M51X5hnuHaB-BB1lIK2HoX46zch9hjvg6_bR9cIgONtJcrBJ-0QyfVzQryXPGVLzu78nb1SkdUr5Fhwbt8ThVWNkoO3IsNlw/iO6hISALarcRcOeLcFwG6Z5JMUly-KEi/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="黄仁勋公开重返英伟达首席执行官，但董事会不予考虑"&gt;黄本人已表示愿意回来&lt;/a&gt;，尽管他与据报道被美国情报部门怀疑为中国资产